, "mime": null, "preview_url": null, "schema": null, "title": "Rapports pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s \u00e0 la Commision des comptes de l'agriculture de la nation", "type": "main", "url": "https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/disaron/Comptes+de+l%2527agriculture/d1cbdec3-c6ec-4a23-bf1d-92b0851d70fd/search/"}], "schema": null, "slug": "agreste-donnees-economiques-agricoles-les-comptes-de-l-agriculture", "spatial": {"geom": null, "granularity": "fr:region", "zones": ["country:fr"]}, "tags": ["agricole", "economie"], "temporal_coverage": null, "title": "Agreste - Donn\u00e9es \u00e9conomiques agricoles : les comptes de l'agriculture", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/agreste-donnees-economiques-agricoles-les-comptes-de-l-agriculture/"}, {"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [], "created_at": "2014-05-23T09:41:45.097000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Rendements et objectifs de rendement, teneur moyenne en prot\u00e9ines,\nparts des surfaces implant\u00e9es avec une culture interm\u00e9diaire, mode de\ndestruction des cultures (m\u00e9canique, chimique, autre),\norigine des semences, doses de semis, modes de tri, traitement des semences,\nmodes d\u2019implantation des cultures (labour, non labour, semis direct),\nd\u00e9sherbage m\u00e9canique,\nfertilisation min\u00e9rale (azote, phosphore, potasse) et organique,\nnombre moyen de traitements phytosanitaires et part des surfaces\ntrait\u00e9es par des pesticides (herbicides, fongicides, insecticides,\nmolluscicide, r\u00e9gulateur de croissance)\npart des surfaces irrigu\u00e9es et quantit\u00e9s d\u2019eau apport\u00e9es,\nmodes d\u2019exploitation des prairies. Indicateurs (indices) de fr\u00e9quence des traitements (IFT).", "description_short": null, "extras": {"datagouv_ckan_id": "ffaaaeac-d4d4-4f03-adfa-01d01e5b4bd4", "datagouv_ckan_last_sync": "2014-09-17T03:38:16.392000"}, "featured": false, "frequency": "quinquennial", "frequency_date": "2016-01-06T00:00:00+00:00", "harvest": null, "id": "53808392a3a7297e4d35d71e", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2014-05-23T09:41:45.097000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-12-17T14:29:53.630000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-12-17T14:29:53.630000+00:00", "last_update": "2025-11-19T20:05:10.998000+00:00", "license": "fr-lo", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 1, "discussions_open": 1, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2024-08": 0, "2024-09": 0, "2024-10": 0, "2024-11": 0, "2024-12": 0, "2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0}, "resources_downloads": 1681, "reuses": 0, "reuses_by_months": {"2024-08": 0, "2024-09": 0, "2024-10": 0, "2024-11": 0, "2024-12": 0, "2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0}, "views": 8723}, "organization": {"acronym": "MAASA", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ca3a7292c64a77edf", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/76/c906161a504b679bf225ad9703cd09.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/76/c906161a504b679bf225ad9703cd09-100.png", "name": "Minist\u00e8re de l'Agriculture, de l'agro-alimentaire et de la souverainet\u00e9 alimentaire", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministere-de-lagriculture-de-lagro-alimentaire-et-de-la-souverainete-alimentaire", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministere-de-lagriculture-de-lagro-alimentaire-et-de-la-souverainete-alimentaire", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministere-de-lagriculture-de-lagro-alimentaire-et-de-la-souverainete-alimentaire/"}, "owner": null, "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/datasets/agreste-pratiques-culturales-sur-les-grandes-cultures-et-prairies", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "edit_resources": false}, "private": false, "quality": {"all_resources_available": false, "dataset_description_quality": true, "has_open_format": true, "has_resources": true, "license": true, "resources_documentation": true, "score": 0.7777777777777778, "spatial": true, "temporal_coverage": false, "update_frequency": true, "update_fulfilled_in_time": true}, "resources": [{"checksum": null, "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:05:10.998000+00:00", "description": "### Principaux sujets trait\u00e9s\n\n\\- les interventions culturales r\u00e9alis\u00e9es de la r\u00e9colte du pr\u00e9c\u00e9dent \u00e0 la r\u00e9colte de la culture interrog\u00e9e (travaux du sol, apports de fumure organique et min\u00e9rale, traitements phytosanitaires)\\\n\\- les rendements et objectifs de rendement, teneur moyenne en prot\u00e9ines, parts des surfaces implant\u00e9es avec une culture interm\u00e9diaire, modes de destruction des cultures (m\u00e9canique, chimique, autre), origine des semences, doses de semis, modes de tri, traitement des semences\\\n\\- les modes d\u2019implantation des cultures (labour, non labour, semis direct)\\\n\\- le d\u00e9sherbage m\u00e9canique\\\n\\- la fertilisation min\u00e9rale (azote, phosphore, potasse) et organique\\\n\\- le nombre moyen de traitements phytosanitaires et part des surfaces trait\u00e9es par des produits phytopharmaceutiques (herbicides, fongicides, insecticides, molluscicide, r\u00e9gulateur de croissance)\n\n#### Publications issues de cette source **[Chiffres et Donn\u00e9es n\u00b02024-13 (septembre 2024)](https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/disaron/Chd2413/detail/ \"Navigation vers la rubrique Chiffres et Analyses\")** - **[Chiffres et Donn\u00e9es n\u00b02024-7 (avril 2024)](https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/disaron/Chd2407/detail/ \"Navigation vers la rubrique Chiffres et Analyses\")**\n", "extras": {"check:available": false, "check:date": "2025-11-19T20:05:14.392000", "check:error": "Cannot connect to host agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr:443 ssl:True [SSLCertVerificationError: (1, '[SSL: CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED] certificate verify failed: unable to get local issuer certificate (_ssl.c:992)')]", "check:id": 36843807, "check:timeout": false}, "filesize": null, "filetype": "remote", "format": "url", "harvest": null, "id": "8db089a3-ee8f-4131-9c7a-8ebaf8f6aa6c", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2025-11-19T20:05:10.998000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-12-17T14:29:53.627000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-12-17T14:29:53.627000+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/8db089a3-ee8f-4131-9c7a-8ebaf8f6aa6c", "metrics": {"views": 340}, "mime": null, "preview_url": null, "schema": null, "title": "Source Pratiques culturales en grandes cultures ", "type": "other", "url": "https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/methodon/S-PK%20GC%202021/methodon/"}], "schema": null, "slug": "agreste-pratiques-culturales-sur-les-grandes-cultures-et-prairies", "spatial": {"geom": null, "granularity": "fr:region", "zones": ["country:fr"]}, "tags": ["agriculture", "fertilisation", "fongicides", "grandes-cultures", "herbicides", "ift", "indicateurs-de-frequence-des-tra", "indices-de-frequence-des-traitem", "insecticides", "molluscicide", "pesticides", "phytosanitaire", "prairies", "rendement", "surfaces-irriguees", "traitements"], "temporal_coverage": null, "title": "Agreste - Pratiques culturales sur les grandes cultures et prairies", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/agreste-pratiques-culturales-sur-les-grandes-cultures-et-prairies/"}, {"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [], "created_at": "2014-03-10T15:14:42.656000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "La for\u00eat priv\u00e9e est d\u00e9finie par opposition \u00e0 la for\u00eat relevant du r\u00e9gime forestier, c'est-\u00e0-dire la for\u00eat\nappartenant \u00e0 l'\u00c9tat, aux collectivit\u00e9s territoriales et \u00e0 certains \u00e9tablissements publics. \\\nLa for\u00eat\npriv\u00e9e comprend donc la for\u00eat appartenant aux personnes physiques ou morales priv\u00e9es et aux\norganismes publics hors r\u00e9gime forestier.\n\\\nLes trois-quarts de la for\u00eat fran\u00e7aise appartiennent \u00e0 des propri\u00e9taires priv\u00e9s.\n\\\nL'enqu\u00eate sur la structure de la for\u00eat priv\u00e9e fran\u00e7aise a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9alis\u00e9e en 1999 et en 2012, derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e disponible. Elle a une\nrepr\u00e9sentativit\u00e9 r\u00e9gionale de la superficie en for\u00eat priv\u00e9e.\\\nCaract\u00e9ristiques des propri\u00e9taires de for\u00eat priv\u00e9e en France m\u00e9tropolitaine et dans 3 Dom (Guadeloupe, Martinique et R\u00e9union)\n\n", "description_short": "Personne physique ou morale, superficie foresti\u00e8re, morcellement, type de peuplement, gestion foresti\u00e8re, r\u00e9colte, travaux forestiers, chasse, accueil du public, fiscalit\u00e9, assurance.", "extras": {"datagouv_ckan_id": "347e5307-5414-48f0-9de8-ecafc7a1a937", "datagouv_ckan_last_sync": "2014-09-17T03:38:08.571000"}, "featured": false, "frequency": "punctual", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": null, "id": "53699443a3a729239d2043db", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2014-03-10T15:14:42.656000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-12-16T15:36:11.733000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-12-16T15:36:11.733000+00:00", "last_update": "2019-07-16T06:17:26.083000+00:00", "license": "fr-lo", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 0, "discussions_open": 0, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2024-08": 0, "2024-09": 0, "2024-10": 0, "2024-11": 0, "2024-12": 0, "2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025