, bois, industrie du bois](https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/disaron/!searchurl/30ae9cb2-3dbd-405d-ab8c-42f7b9ccbe24!639fd261-bac7-4a79-95e8-5bfdd0ebd4fa!ee544c16-0429-48bc-b614-150cec98259e!90bd1296-0378-4cb9-a059-80918aa13577/search/)\"\n\n", "extras": {"check:available": false, "check:count-availability": 88, "check:date": "2023-06-01T19:36:42.981000", "check:error": "Cannot connect to host stats.agriculture.gouv.fr:443 ssl:True [SSLCertVerificationError: (1, '[SSL: CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED] certificate verify failed: unable to get local issuer certificate (_ssl.c:1123)')]", "check:headers:charset": "utf-8", "check:timeout": false, "check:url": "https://stats.agriculture.gouv.fr/disar-web/disaron/!searchurl/30ae9cb2-3dbd-405d-ab8c-42f7b9ccbe24!639fd261-bac7-4a79-95e8-5bfdd0ebd4fa!ee544c16-0429-48bc-b614-150cec98259e/search.disar"}, "filesize": null, "filetype": "remote", "format": "url", "harvest": null, "id": "cf331617-fac4-46d4-87d8-668b1fea144c", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2014-05-07T04:02:43.879000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-12-16T15:36:11.731000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-12-16T15:36:11.731000+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/cf331617-fac4-46d4-87d8-668b1fea144c", "metrics": {"nb_hits": 0, "nb_uniq_visitors": 0, "nb_visits": 0, "views": 339}, "mime": null, "preview_url": null, "schema": null, "title": "Enqu\u00eate sur la structure de la for\u00eat priv\u00e9e", "type": "main", "url": "https://agreste.agriculture.gouv.fr/agreste-web/methodon/S-Structure%20for%C3%AAt%20priv%C3%A9e%202012/methodon/"}], "schema": null, "slug": "agreste-enquete-sur-la-structure-de-la-foret-privee", "spatial": {"geom": null, "granularity": "fr:departement", "zones": ["country:fr"]}, "tags": ["agriculture", "enquete", "foret-privee", "peuplement", "superficie-forestiere", "travaux-forestiers"], "temporal_coverage": {"end": "2012-12-31", "start": "1999-01-01"}, "title": "Agreste - Enqu\u00eate sur la structure de la for\u00eat priv\u00e9e", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/agreste-enquete-sur-la-structure-de-la-foret-privee/"}, {"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [], "created_at": "2014-10-24T15:49:31.379000+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Description des exploitations agricoles entre les recensements qui ont lieu tous les 10 ans : d\u00e9mographie des exploitations agricoles et bilan des moyens de production, main-d'\u0153uvre, superficies, cheptels.\nP\u00e9riodicit\u00e9 : Tous les 2-3 ans sur les p\u00e9riodes intercensitaires\nAnn\u00e9es de collecte : 2003 -2005 -2007 entre les recensements 2000 et 2010. Puis 2013 et 2016 entre les recensements 2010 et 2020. Puis 2023 et 2026 entre les recensements de 2020 et 2030.\n", "description_short": null, "extras": {}, "featured": false, "frequency": "triennial", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": null, "id": "544a58ebc751df42579bbff9", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2014-10-24T15:49:31.379000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2025-12-09T16:38:07.913000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2025-12-09T16:38:07.913000+00:00", "last_update": "2025-12-09T16:35:01.764000+00:00", "license": "fr-lo", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 2, "discussions_open": 2, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2024-08": 0, "2024-09": 0, "2024-10": 0, "2024-11": 0, "2024-12": 0, "2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0}, "resources_downloads": 1016, "reuses": 0, "reuses_by_months": {"2024-08": 0, "2024-09": 0, "2024-10": 0, "2024-11": 0, "2024-12": 0, "2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0}, "views": 7169}, "organization": {"acronym": "MAASA", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certif